    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an investigative journalist in Harlem, in the early 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has been murdered, and the explanations that the police have come up with just don't add up. Furthermore, the person that the police are accusing of the murder is a good friend of yours, so you'll do anything you can to find out the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Pictures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to collect evidence; take pictures of anything that seems important to the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/2150a3be31efb46cdb6b9b1738e1f3ac.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize Evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the evidence you collected in your journal, where you can organize and look at the pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/b7f49e8b7fe062784c5473243463699b.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people to try and find out what they know. But be careful, some might try to lie to you, and hide the truth. Get their testimonies and piece together the real story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/88584843277fcfaaef5445f09ada8654.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the Case</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your case in the article and publish it to expose the true killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/7308828a690162215ed0ede5ba29e5d6.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an investigative journalist in Harlem, in the early 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has been murdered, and the explanations that the police have come up with just don't add up. Furthermore, the person that the police are accusing of the murder is a good friend of yours, so you'll do anything you can to find out the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Pictures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to collect evidence; take pictures of anything that seems important to the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/2150a3be31efb46cdb6b9b1738e1f3ac.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Organize Evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the evidence you collected in your journal, where you can organize and look at the pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/b7f49e8b7fe062784c5473243463699b.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to people to try and find out what they know. But be careful, some might try to lie to you, and hide the truth. Get their testimonies and piece together the real story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/88584843277fcfaaef5445f09ada8654.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the Case</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your case in the article and publish it to expose the true killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/7308828a690162215ed0ede5ba29e5d6.avif?t=1750659541\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
